00:57:20.544 --> 00:57:22.854
you stack up a lot of rules,

00:57:23.664 --> 00:57:28.494
if then rules, and then you can explain
how the human cognition works.

00:57:29.304 --> 00:57:31.533
But that turned out, well, not maybe

00:57:32.224 --> 00:57:37.544
wrong, but at least not a very good way
